  "description": "Validate, index, create, draft, review, and analyze the code impact of Architecture Decision Records from the command line. ADR Guard provides deterministic Markdown checks, explicit ADR-to-code mappings, offline ADR generation, optional human-reviewed AI-assisted drafting, and evidence-oriented advisory analysis.",
